{"version": 2, "width": 78, "height": 66, "timestamp": 1787987720, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.161332, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.515579, "o", "  ONE DEPOT, ONE NIGHT, THREE SETTLEMENTS\r\n"]
[0.641224, "o", "  depot-north — 18 vans on a congestion-constrained connection\r\n"]
[0.771671, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.137838, "o", "ACT 1  the meter reports\r\n"]
[2.05085, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.18927, "o", "  02:00: 22 kW   register 105500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.323684, "o", "  02:15: 22 kW   register 111000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.463623, "o", "  02:30: 22 kW   register 116500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.599689, "o", "  02:45: 22 kW   register 122000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.729813, "o", "  03:00: 22 kW   register 127500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.859399, "o", "  03:15: 15 kW   register 131250 Wh\r\n"]
[2.988921, "o", "  03:30: 15 kW   register 135000 Wh\r\n"]
[3.121866, "o", "  03:45: 15 kW   register 138750 Wh\r\n"]
[3.25092, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.613469, "o", "  every reading signed by the charge point's own key, verifiable\r\n"]
[3.749525, "o", "  offline by anyone holding the platform's public key\r\n"]
[3.884733, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.240656, "o", "ACT 2  the aggregator asks to curtail\r\n"]
[5.15726, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[5.293807, "o", "  03:14: curtail depot-north-cp-04 from 22 kW to 7 kW for 40 minutes\r\n"]
[5.425594, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.791796, "o", "  no capability: REFUSED — malformed capability token\r\n"]
[5.929197, "o", "  wrong issuer: REFUSED — capability token signature is not valid for this issuer\r\n"]
[6.058526, "o", "  the real capability: held for review — shed of 15000W is at or above the review threshold of 11000W\r\n"]
[6.190861, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.552713, "o", "  15 kW is within the 15 kW granted but past the 11 kW review threshold,\r\n"]
[6.686045, "o", "  and no operator is wired in — so the command is NOT dispatched.\r\n"]
[6.81185, "o", "  Nothing reached the charge point. The refusal is on the record.\r\n"]
[6.948262, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.310451, "o", "  re-presented, 7 kW shed: allowed\r\n"]
[7.442503, "o", "  03:14: SetChargingProfile dispatched, hung under the authority that permitted it\r\n"]
[7.578069, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.94433, "o", "ACT 3  morning — three settlements, one chain\r\n"]
[8.862874, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[8.998434, "o", "  energy bill: 38 kWh   EUR 10.64\r\n"]
[9.129911, "o", "  flexibility payment: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48\r\n"]
[9.259858, "o", "  baseline used: 22 kW, metered 15 kW\r\n"]
[9.392801, "o", "  method: nominated baseline  fingerprint e19ee448668d7b77\r\n"]
[9.527533, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.887835, "o", "  aggregator invoices: 10 kWh — the 15 kW shed it asked for at 03:14\r\n"]
[10.022971, "o", "  meter says: 4666 Wh — the 7 kW shed that was actually dispatched\r\n"]
[10.159425, "o", "  over-claim: 114%\r\n"]
[10.293647, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.661474, "o", "  the DSO pays the aggregator: 10 kWh   EUR 1.80 — on the claim\r\n"]
[10.790243, "o", "  the aggregator pays the depot: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48 — on the meter\r\n"]
[10.924393, "o", "  kept on the gap: EUR 1.32\r\n"]
[11.051194, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.421675, "o", "  the deep shed was HELD in Act 2, so it never reached the meter. The\r\n"]
[11.550681, "o", "  aggregator is paid upstream for a shed that did not happen, and pays\r\n"]
[11.683559, "o", "  downstream for the one that did. Both sides are on this chain, and the\r\n"]
[11.812045, "o", "  DSO — who was never in the room — can walk it.\r\n"]
[11.936464, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.292712, "o", "  The percentage is recorded, not enforced: a threshold belongs in a\r\n"]
[12.42827, "o", "  contract, not in a library.\r\n"]
[12.561338, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.926805, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.291942, "o", "  all three derive from the same signed readings. Walking up from the\r\n"]
[13.429463, "o", "  DSO's payment — the furthest party from the meter:\r\n"]
[13.56331, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.929214, "o", "    settlement.grid\r\n"]
[14.063582, "o", "    settlement.flex\r\n"]
[14.196194, "o", "    curtail.applied\r\n"]
[14.322001, "o", "    grid.allowed\r\n"]
[14.457806, "o", "    grid.intent\r\n"]
[14.593718, "o", "    curtail.command\r\n"]
[14.727934, "o", "    meter.reading\r\n"]
[14.862443, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.229188, "o", "ACT 4  somebody edits a meter value\r\n"]
[16.138396, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[16.268424, "o", "  edit: 03:15 register 131250 Wh -> 134750 Wh   (+3.5 kWh of flexibility, worth EUR 0.42)\r\n"]
[16.399653, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.76274, "o", "  result: signature check fails at 03:15 — that reading, and only that reading\r\n"]
[16.896347, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.259877, "o", "  the edit did not need to be guessed at. Every other reading still\r\n"]
[17.388528, "o", "  verifies, so the chain names the one that does not.\r\n"]
[17.516598, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.876491, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[18.012041, "o", "  Every settlement above walks back to a signed meter reading,\r\n"]
[18.148586, "o", "  through the capability that authorised the command that changed it.\r\n"]
[18.280582, "o", "  A command without that authority never reached the charge point.\r\n"]
[18.417312, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.784142, "o", "  The baseline remains a model. This makes the flexibility claim\r\n"]
[18.916695, "o", "  checkable and replayable by any party — not true.\r\n"]
[19.054198, "o", "\r\n"]
